# Two files Prettier must leave alone.
#
# src/ui/app-shell.html is the original application's markup, kept as it
# came so it can still be diffed against 8bitforge.8binami.app/app.html.
# Reflowing 3789 lines would end that, and the markup is read far more
# often than it is written.
#
# assets/css/premium-light.css aligns its trailing comments into a column
# by hand. Prettier collapses that alignment, which is the only thing
# making a wall of custom properties readable.
src/ui/app-shell.html
assets/css/premium-light.css
